              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "गिनाना — ginānā — \"to list, to enumerate (reasons, faults)\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "मीरा ने तीन कारण गिनाए। Mīrā ne tīn kāraṇ gināe. Mira listed three reasons."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past, with ने (he or she …): उसने कई कारण गिनाए, usne kaī kāraṇ gināe."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "गिनाना (ginānā) is the causative of गिनना, \"to count\", which is inherited from Sanskrit gaṇayati, \"counts\" (CDIAL 3993): to make the items count out, one by one."
            }
          ]
        },
